  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry snap peas. Set aside."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, and juice lemon into a blender. (Alternatively, the hummus can be prepared in a food processor.)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain and rinse chickpeas. Add to the blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel and roughly chop garlic. Add to the blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop sun-dried tomatoes. Add to the blender along with water, tahini, oil, and spices. Blend on high for several minutes until smooth. Add more water to the hummus, one tablespoon at a time, if needed, to reach desired consistency."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide hummus and snap peas between plates. Enjoy!"
    }
